		{
			dependencies: ["3F4DB5EEDFFAC808"]
			description: [
				"Before engaging a Mowzie's Mobs encounter, clear ordinary enemies, study the arena, and watch the creature move. Windups, projectiles, area control, and recovery animations reveal the intended openings."
				"Carry a shield or ranged option where appropriate, but do not assume every attack can be blocked or face-tanked. Preserve stamina, space, food, and an escape route while learning one pattern at a time."
				"After victory, identify the reward in JEI and record the location or summoning conditions. Encounter knowledge is the real reusable drop; the item only proves the lesson was survived once."
